      <scopecontent id="aspace_2c7963b960a33b27214a59777e03cfee">
         <head>Scope and Contents</head>
         <p>The records consist of correspondence, course materials, administrative files, subject files and reports maintained by Csaba Horvath and Daniel E. Rosner, who both served as chair of the Yale Department of Chemical Engineering. The records document departmental affairs, undergraduate chemical engineering courses, and graduate students.</p>
